# Skeleton preview panel (Global tab, right column). {diff}/{hp}/{out}/{in} are DATA, not translated prose.
ui.global.preview_title = Preview: Skeleton
ui.global.preview_note = A plain Skeleton through the curve on the left, at five difficulties between your minimum and maximum. Health and hit show the real number once the mod has seen one: the health a Skeleton spawned with, the last hit one landed. Kill time is how many times longer it takes to kill than an unscaled mob. An amber rail note means a ceiling is holding that row down, so raising the slope changes nothing there.
ui.global.preview_row = D{diff}   HP {hp}   Hit {out}   Taken {in}%
